Package: dragonegg-sdrmm-rx
Version: 0.1.0-3
Section: hamradio
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Bletchley West Labs <ops@localhost>
Depends: adduser, systemd, python3, ca-certificates, iproute2
Description: DragonEgg SDR-- receive-only network-client package
 Network-client-only SDR-- UI plus DragonEgg RX-only rtl_tcp bridge.
 Services install disabled and fail closed unless the exact LimeSDR Mini v2 serial
 is present and an Ops gate explicitly enables/starts them.
